From 298beab5636fbd83a51ec3fbb80dc627723c7cc6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ralph Sennhauser <ralph.sennhauser@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Aug 2024 09:37:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/1] Apply all WFG changes

This is an all in one patch of all modifications done in
https://svn.wildfiregames.com/public/source-libs/trunk/nvtt/

There are patches in the above svn repo which supposedly should lead to
the modified nvtt but they don't match the actual modifications on top
of nvtt-2.1.1 done by WFG.

Signed-off-by: Ralph Sennhauser <ralph.sennhauser@gmail.com>
