-/*
-we're using this table to assign lsbs
-abgr	>=2	correct
-0000	0	0
-0001	0	0
-0010	0	0
-0011	1	x1
-0100	0	0
-0101	1	x1
-0110	1	x1
-0111	1	1
-1000	0	0
-1001	1	x0
-1010	1	x0
-1011	1	1
-1100	1	x0
-1101	1	1
-1110	1	1
-1111	1	1
-
-we need 8 0's and 8 1's. the x's can be either 0 or 1 as long as you get 8/8.
-I choose to assign the lsbs so that the rgb channels are as good as possible.
